<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Invitation to join the team</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background-color: #000000;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Invitation to join Zenith</h2>
        <p>Hello,</p>
        
        <p>Your email address has been added to the <strong>Zenith</strong> system. To get access to the corporate portal, please click the link below and create your account:</p>
        
        <center>
            <a href="{{registrationUrl}}" class="button">Accept Invitation</a>
        </center>
        
        <p>This link will be active for 7 days till <strong>{{invitationDeadline}}</strong>.</p>
        
        <p>If you were not expecting this email, please simply ignore it.</p>
        
        <p>Best regards,<br>The Zenith Team</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
